  "body_html": "<h1>blockSum_pushTowardsZ_formula</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma blockSum_pushTowardsZ_formula (i : I) (x : BigSimplex card) : blockSum card i (pushTowardsZ card x) = (1 - tPush card x) * blockSum card i x + (tPush card x) * blockWeight card i</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BigSimplex</li>\n</ul>",
